@startuml pseudo-labeling-swimlane
title WS4: Pseudo-Labeling - Module Swimlane\nv1.0 | February 2026

skinparam dpi 150
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #F8F8F8
  BorderColor #BBBBBB
}

|Dataset Loading|
start
:Load benchmark datasets\n(DIQA-5000: 5.5K, OHR-Bench: 8.5K);
note right
  **Source**: modal/stage1_deqa_inference.py
  **LOC**: 492
  GCS streaming, batch iteration
end note
:Validate image integrity\n(SHA256 checksums);
:Create inference batches\n(batch_size=32);

|Track A: Classical Models|
:Run MUSIQ inference\n(sharpness/naturalness);
:Run QualiCLIP inference\n(color fidelity, aesthetics);
:Run DocIQ-Replica inference\n(document-specific overall);
note right
  **Source**: modal/generate_pseudo_labels.py
  **LOC**: 1,042
  Parallel inference on Modal A10 GPU
  3 models, ~500ms total per image
end note

|Track B: VLM Models|
:Run Qwen3-VL-8B inference\n(structured quality assessment);
:Run InternVL3-8B inference\n(document understanding);
note right
  **Source**: modal/teacher_inference.py
  **LOC**: 419
  VLM structured output parsing
  ~2s per image per model
end note

|Ensemble Stacking|
:Compute per-dimension\nvariance weights;
:Apply hierarchical stacker\n(dimension-specific voting);
:Merge Track A + Track B\ninto unified score vector;
note right
  **Stacking Logic**:
  - Per-dimension variance weighting
  - Higher agreement = higher weight
  - Outlier model down-weighted
  **Metrics**: modal/shared/metrics_utils.py (223 LOC)
end note

|Calibration|
:Apply temperature scaling\n(learned T per dimension);
if (ECE < 0.1?) then (yes)
  :Calibration validated;
else (no)
  :Retune temperature\nparameters;
  :Re-validate ECE;
endif

|Confidence Filtering|
:Compute inter-model\nagreement score;
if (Agreement > 0.8?) then (yes)
  :Accept pseudo-label;
else (no)
  :Route to dead-letter queue\n(manual review or discard);
endif

|Output|
:Write pseudo-labels\nto partitioned parquet;
:Compute dataset statistics\n(coverage, confidence distribution);
:Select best checkpoint\nfor model registry\n(weighted SRCC + ECE scoring);
note right
  **Output**: metadata_registry/parquet/
  **GCS**: modal/shared/gcs_utils.py (130 LOC)
  **Constants**: modal/shared/constants.py (58 LOC)
end note
note right
  **WS4 Pseudo-Labeling Pipeline**
  Total: ~2,947 LOC across Modal scripts
  Infrastructure: Modal serverless GPU (A10)
  Storage: GCS buckets for datasets + labels
  Downstream: WS2 training, WS6 arena validation
end note
stop

@enduml
